          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பீதி — pīti — \"panic; dread\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நிலநடுக்கத்தின்போது மக்களிடம் பீதி பரவியது. nilanaṭukkattiṉpōtu makkaḷiṭam pīti paraviyatu. During the earthquake panic spread among the people."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பீதி (pīti) அடை, to panic (literally to reach panic)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பீதி (pīti) is borrowed from Sanskrit bhīti, \"fear\" (CDIAL 9512); Tamil writes the bh as ப."
            }
          ]
        },
